<p>When you store a body you also store <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> more identical copies of it that you can use later.</p><p>When you store a rare/unique/boss or higher rank creature you only get a third of the uses (but never less than one).</p>